  "description": "Jeong-heon is an acting prodigy who completely transforms the moment the camera starts rolling. To help his benefactor Jae-woo—who has fallen into despair after losing his dreams—Jeong-heon resolves to turn Jae-woo's screenplay into a movie. However, when he approaches the film club to uncover the truth, he discovers it is actually a hideout for notorious school delinquents. Can Jeong-heon face down the worst troublemakers, safely wrap up the film, and reignite Jae-woo's shattered dreams?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
